756	    // of it would be noise.
757	    //
758	    // The schedule drops back to the plain calendar deadline (already in the past by
759	    // now), so this attempt CANNOT defer the suspension it precedes. When the admin
760	    // kill switch is off nothing will ever be suspended, so fall back to a daily
761	    // cadence instead — otherwise a 10-minute sweep would attempt the same declining
